ain\n- fever/chills\n- vomiting\n- dizziness/fainting\n- reduced urine output\n\nIf you want, I can also format this as:\n1. a **clinical handoff note**, or  \n2. a **very short message to send your doctor immediately**.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_05b41355eb12ff050169b93ea151f4819196bfa422ea44bea3\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":3115,"output":468,"cacheRead":21760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25343,"cost":{"input":0.007787500000000001,"output":0.00702,"cacheRead":0.0054399999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0202475}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773747868794}}
